    url: "https://elpais.com/internacional/2026-10-02/el-piloto-apunalado-en-el-vuelo-de-flydubai-entre-dubai-y-tel-aviv-me-dije-que-la-puerta-estaba-ahi-que-solo-tenia-que-abrirla.html",
